<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 02:47:13 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>消息人士称，美国将向瑞致达提供 42 亿美元贷款，以提高核电产量</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/u-s-to-lend-4-2-billion-to-vistra-to-boost-nuclear-power-output-source-says</link><description>这位不愿透露姓名的人士表示，美国能源部长克里斯·赖特将于周一在瑞致达位于俄亥俄州伊利湖沿岸的核电站宣布这笔贷款。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/u-s-to-lend-4-2-billion-to-vistra-to-boost-nuclear-power-output-source-says.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 02:47:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/u-s-to-lend-4-2-billion-to-vistra-to-boost-nuclear-power-output-source-says</guid></item><item><title>Google Suncatcher 的下一步行动：到 2027 年拥有 2 颗卫星</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/google-suncatchers-next-act-2-satellites-by-2027</link><description>Planet 的业务建立在地球成像卫星上，而不是人工智能加速器上，这使得这对搭档值得重新审视。该公司自己关于该交易的声明将其视为分包工作，而更多地视为研究问题的共同所有权。 Planet 表示很高兴宣布参与谷歌的 Suncatcher 项目，称这是一项大胆的研究计划，旨在探索在太空中构建可扩展的机器学习计算系统&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/google-suncatchers-next-act-2-satellites-by-2027.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 02:32:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/google-suncatchers-next-act-2-satellites-by-2027</guid></item><item><title>Life Biosciences 将在 Eyecelerator 2026 上展示正在进行的评估 ER-100 治疗视神经病变的 1 期试验的首次人体数据</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/life-biosciences-to-present-first-in-human-data-from-ongoing-phase-1-trial-evaluating-er-100-in-optic-neuropathies-at-eyecelerator-2026</link><description>“患有与年龄相关的视力丧失的人，例如我们目前关注的两种视神经病变，即开角型青光眼 (OAG) 和非动脉炎性前部缺血性视神经病变 (NAION)，没有治疗方案可以解决视网膜神经节细胞的潜在损伤。通过 ER-100，我们正在测试是否可以将这些细胞恢复到更年轻的状态，不仅可以减缓视力丧失，而且有可能逆转它。”Sharon 说Rosenzweig-Lipson 博士，Life Bio 首席科学官。 “被选中展示 Eyecelerator @ AAO 第一阶段研究的初步数据是对我们工作影响的有意义的验证，我们期待与更广泛的科学界分享我们的经验。”&lt;img src="https://www.lifebiosciences.com/" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 02:17:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/life-biosciences-to-present-first-in-human-data-from-ongoing-phase-1-trial-evaluating-er-100-in-optic-neuropathies-at-eyecelerator-2026</guid></item><item><title>飞行信号塔从 10 英里高空向日本发射电话信号</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/flying-cell-tower-beams-phone-signal-to-japan-from-10-miles-up</link><description>一艘无人驾驶的 Sceye 飞艇从新墨西哥州飞往日本并返回，从平流层向普通电话发送移动蜂窝服务。虽然这仍是一个考验，但日本主要移动运营商之一软银希望从 2027 年开始在日本提供商业服务。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/flying-cell-tower-beams-phone-signal-to-japan-from-10-miles-up2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 02:02:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/flying-cell-tower-beams-phone-signal-to-japan-from-10-miles-up</guid></item><item><title>美国 Seaglider 的目标是在岸上或船上充电时速度达到 180 英里/小时</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/us-seaglider-targets-180-mph-speeds-with-shore-or-ship-charging</link><description>美国海军陆战队作战实验室扩大了与电动 Seaglider 开发商 REGENT Craft 的合作，增加了 500 万美元用于原型能力演示和命令与控制集成。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/us-seaglider-targets-180-mph-speeds-with-shore-or-ship-charging.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 01:47:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/us-seaglider-targets-180-mph-speeds-with-shore-or-ship-charging</guid></item><item><title>认识信天翁：它像树叶一样坠落、旋转、自我恢复和扬帆远航</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/meet-albatross-it-falls-spins-self-rights-and-sails-away-like-a-leaf</link><description>您每周精选的精彩机器人视频包括用于灾难恢复的自组装模块化手臂以及在尼泊尔洪灾后使用无人机&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/meet-albatross-it-falls-spins-self-rights-and-sails-away-like-a-leaf.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 01:32:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/meet-albatross-it-falls-spins-self-rights-and-sails-away-like-a-leaf</guid></item><item><title>科学家探测到来自太阳系以外行星的无线电信号</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/scientists-have-detected-radio-signals-from-a-planet-beyond-our-solar-system</link><description>发现标志着无线电信号首次被确认来自单个行星而不是整个系统。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-have-detected-radio-signals-from-a-planet-beyond-our-solar-system.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 01:17:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/scientists-have-detected-radio-signals-from-a-planet-beyond-our-solar-system</guid></item><item><title>最好的人类长寿实验室（你可能从未听说过）</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/the-best-human-longevity-lab-that-youve-probably-never-heard-of</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 01:02:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/the-best-human-longevity-lab-that-youve-probably-never-heard-of</guid></item><item><title>量子引力的第一个证据？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/first-evidence-for-quantum-gravity</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 00:47:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/first-evidence-for-quantum-gravity</guid></item><item><title>甲骨文将支付波因特海滩核电站的核电费用以运营华盛顿港数据中心</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/oracle-to-pay-for-nuclear-power-from-point-beach-plant-to-run-port-washington-data-center</link><description>该协议超出了国家要求数据中心支付 100% 建设为其园区供电所需的发电设施成本的要求。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/oracle-to-pay-for-nuclear-power-from-point-beach-plant-to-run-port-washington-data-center.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 16:05:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/oracle-to-pay-for-nuclear-power-from-point-beach-plant-to-run-port-washington-data-center</guid></item></channel></rss>